Quest 1013 "Gargoyle hunt"
    Journal "[Ascetic] Veda asked me to hunt 40 Gargoyles."
    Kill 40 of 17017, 7017 at direction_611

Requires player level >= 64 and player is karus and quest 315 is completed

Rewards
    Give 26250000 experience

direction_611 = location "Gargoyle" about "Gargoyle\nOriginally a stone statue, it is endowed with life only via an ancient spell. After the war against Pathos, the seal has been permanently and they now pose a threat to mankind. " found "Karus Eslant" at 228 675 in zone 11

On available
    Say "Master, There's a monster with a devil's shape! I'll bet Veda knows about it."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "The devil-shaped monster is actually a Gargoyle."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "It's a stony monster with the devil's visage that owes its life to an ancient spell. After the war against Pathos, the seals were permanently removed and it's been stuck here threatening humans ever since. I think it'd be good to 'train' on these beasts next. Heh."

On ready
    Say "It's a terrible monster to be sure. Wasn't it? I don't want to mess with them again. Anyway, we were fortunate to finish all that without any troubles."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
